TOKEN tinybird_ingest APPEND
TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    An account's first onboarding (setup) quest reward on a private email
    domain, sent by Enter. email_domain is the registrable domain only, never
    the address; public mail providers are never sent. Read by the
    infra-watch signups monitor to report bulk sign-ups. Rows expire after
    30 days.

SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3) `json:$.timestamp`,
    `environment` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.environment`,
    `user_id` String `json:$.user_id`,
    `email_domain` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.email_domain`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "environment, timestamp"
ENGINE_TTL "toDateTime(timestamp) + toIntervalDay(30)"
